# Docker Volume 💾

**Docker Volume = Container ka data permanently save karne ke liye.**

Container delete/recreate hone par bhi **data safe** rehta hai.

### Create

```bash
docker volume create mongo-data
```

### List

```bash
docker volume ls
```

### Use with Container

```bash
docker run -d \
  --name mongo \
  -v mongo-data:/data/db \
  mongo
```

### Inspect

```bash
docker volume inspect mongo-data
```

### Delete

```bash
docker volume rm mongo-data
```

### MERN Example

```text
MongoDB Container
       ↓
Docker Volume
       ↓
Database Data 💾
```

**Remember:**

```text
Network → Containers ko connect 🔗
Volume  → Data ko save 💾
```






